### 결제 요청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123!
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": 1, "cardType": "SAMSUNG", "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456" }

### PG 콜백 (성공)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transactionKey": "tx-1", "orderId": 1, "amount": 10000, "status": "SUCCESS" }

### PG 콜백 (실패)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transactionKey": "tx-1", "orderId": 1, "amount": 10000, "status": "FAILED", "reason": "LIMIT_EXCEEDED" }

### 운영 수동 동기화
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/1/sync
